unit: tests/main.cpp
---

# mm.mcu test target

Exercises every entry point of the portable hardware interface against a
stand-in platform. platform.cpp registers a Platform subclass during static
initialisation, the same pure C++ seam a selected provider module uses. A host
test needs no platform-provider binding: mm.mcu's fallback is linkable there and
the stand-in replaces it before the cases run. The unit is listed first only to
keep the test's implementation before its cases in declared source order.
